      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything in my family feels so... poised. like a museum. my grandfather, my mother, even my siblings, they all carry this weight of excellence so effortlessly. and then there's me. i feel like the one thing that doesn't belong. like i've somehow tainted the whole lineage just by existing. it's exhausting trying to pretend i'm not a crack in the foundation.",
